Binary search level + Max-Flow (FM: forgetting \(1 + 1 = 2\) creates odd cycles!).


Complement of Two Cliques & Critical Matching Edges (#039: add edge to \(G\) to increase \(\omega(G)\))
Build complement \(\bar{G} = (L \sqcup R, \bar{E})\); \(\omega(G) = \alpha(\bar{G}) = |V| - \nu(\bar{G})\).
Matched edge \(e = (u,v) \in M^*\) is critical iff scc[u] != scc[v] in \(G_{f^*}\).
\(O((V + \bar{E})\sqrt{V})\) Dinic + \(O(V + \bar{E})\) Tarjan SCC on \(G_{f^*}\).

